#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GDM"
msgstr "Instalação do GDM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"It is recommended to have a dedicated user and group to take control of the "
"<command>gdm</command> daemon after it is started. Issue the following "
"commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"É recomendado ter um(a) usuário(a) e um grupo dedicado(a) para assumir o "
"controle do processo de segundo plano &quot;<command>gdm</command>&quot; "
"depois de ele ser iniciado. Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a)"
" &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 21 gdm &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"GDM Daemon Owner\" -d /var/lib/gdm -u 21 \\\n"
"        -g gdm -s /bin/false gdm &amp;&amp;\n"
"passwd -ql gdm</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 21 gdm &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Proprietário(a) do Processo de Segundo Plano GDM\" -d /var/lib/gdm -u 21 \\\n"
"        -g gdm -s /bin/false gdm &amp;&amp;\n"
"passwd -ql gdm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid "First, adapt GDM to build with GCC 15:"
msgstr "Primeiro, adapte GDM para construir com GCC 15:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:127
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -r 's/([(*])bool([) ])/\\1boolval\\2/' -i "
"common/gdm-settings-utils.*</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -r 's/([(*])bool([) ])/\\1boolval\\2/' -i "
"common/gdm-settings-utils.*</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GDM</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>GDM</application>&quot; executando os seguintes"
" comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:135
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's@systemd@elogind@'                                \\\n"
"    -e 's/-session optional/-session required/'            \\\n"
"    -e '/elogind/isession  required       pam_loginuid.so' \\\n"
"\n"
"    -i data/pam-lfs/gdm-launch-environment.pam &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -D gdm-xsession=true       \\\n"
"      -D initial-vt=7            \\\n"
"      -D run-dir=/run/gdm        \\\n"
"      -D logind-provider=elogind \\\n"
"      -D systemd-journal=false   \\\n"
"      -D systemdsystemunitdir=no \\\n"
"      -D systemduserunitdir=no   &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's@systemd@elogind@'                                \\\n"
"    -e 's/-session optional/-session required/'            \\\n"
"    -e '/elogind/isession  required       pam_loginuid.so' \\\n"
"\n"
"    -i data/pam-lfs/gdm-launch-environment.pam &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -D gdm-xsession=true       \\\n"
"      -D initial-vt=7            \\\n"
"      -D run-dir=/run/gdm        \\\n"
"      -D logind-provider=elogind \\\n"
"      -D systemd-journal=false   \\\n"
"      -D systemdsystemunitdir=no \\\n"
"      -D systemduserunitdir=no   &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:156
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..             \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release  \\\n"
"      -D gdm-xsession=true \\\n"
"      -D run-dir=/run/gdm  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..             \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release  \\\n"
"      -D gdm-xsession=true \\\n"
"      -D run-dir=/run/gdm  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test suite requires <application>Check</application> that we've removed "
"from LFS."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste exige <application>Check</application> que nós removemos do"
" LFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:175
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:188
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D initial-vt=7</parameter>: This switch starts GDM on VT7 by "
"default, since on SysV systems, elogind is not available until it gets "
"activated by PAM during a login session. The default behavior is to start on"
" the currently active TTY, but this behavior causes GDM to fail to start in "
"virtual environments and other situations where Wayland is not supported."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D initial-vt=7</parameter>: Essa chave inicia o GDM no VT7 por "
"padrão, já que, em sistemas SysV, o elogind não está disponível até ser "
"ativado pelo PAM durante uma sessão de login. O comportamento padrão é o de "
"iniciar no TTY atualmente ativo, mas esse comportamento faz com que o GDM "
"falhe para iniciar em ambientes virtuais e em outras situações onde Wayland "
"não seja suportado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D default-pam-config=lfs</option>: Use this switch if you did not "
"create the <filename>/etc/lfs-release</filename> file or distribution auto "
"detection will fail and you will be unable to use "
"<application>GDM</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D default-pam-config=lfs</option>: Use essa chave se você não criou"
" o arquivo <filename>/etc/lfs-release</filename> ou a detecção automática da"
" distribuição falhará e você estará inapto(a) para usar o "
"<application>GDM</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D gdm-xsession=true</parameter>: This enables the installation "
"of the <application>GDM</application> Xsession file."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D gdm-xsession=true</parameter>: Isso habilita a instalação do "
"arquivo Xsession do <application>GDM</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring GDM"
msgstr "Configurando o GDM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:218
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>/etc/gdm/custom.conf</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>/etc/gdm/custom.conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:222
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/gdm/custom.conf"
msgstr "/etc/gdm/custom.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:228
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:231
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The GDM daemon is configured using the "
"<filename>/etc/gdm/custom.conf</filename> file. Default values are stored in"
" GSettings in the <filename>gdm.schemas</filename> file. It is recommended "
"that end-users modify the <filename>/etc/gdm/custom.conf</filename> file "
"because the schemas file may be overwritten when the user updates their "
"system to have a newer version of <application>GDM</application>."
msgstr ""
"O processo de segundo plano &quot;GDM&quot; é configurado usando o arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/gdm/custom.conf</filename>&quot;. Os valores padrão são"
" armazenados em &quot;GSettings&quot; no arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>gdm.schemas</filename>&quot;. É recomendado que os(as) "
"usuários(as) finais modifiquem o arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/gdm/custom.conf</filename>&quot;, porque o arquivo de "
"esquemas possivelmente seja sobrescrito quando o(a) usuário(a) atualizar o "
"sistema dele(a) para ter uma versão mais recente do "
"&quot;<application>GDM</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:241
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"On some systems with NVIDIA GPUs or virtual GPUs (such as provided by qemu),"
" GDM will hide Wayland sessions by default. This is often done to prevent "
"users from encountering problems with buggy drivers, which can result in "
"system lockups, application crashes, power management problems, and graphics"
" slowdowns. If your system is a virtual machine or you have an NVIDIA GPU "
"and still want to try running Wayland sessions anyway, execute the following"
" command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Em alguns sistemas com GPUs NVIDIA ou GPUs virtuais (como as fornecidas pelo"
" qemu), o GDM ocultará as sessões do Wayland por padrão. Isso geralmente é "
"feito para evitar que os(as) usuários(as) encontrem problemas com "
"controladores defeituosos, o que pode resultar em travamentos do sistema, "
"quebras de aplicativos, problemas de gerenciamento de eletricidade e "
"lentidão gráfica. Se teu sistema for uma máquina virtual ou você tiver uma "
"GPU NVIDIA e ainda quiser tentar executar sessões do Wayland, execute o "
"seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:251
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ln -s /dev/null /etc/udev/rules.d/61-gdm.rules</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ln -s /dev/null /etc/udev/rules.d/61-gdm.rules</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:256
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de "
"Inicialização</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">Unidade do "
"systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:260 blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:368
#, xml-text
msgid "gdm"
msgstr "gdm"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:264
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start <command>gdm</command> automatically when the system is switched to"
" runlevel 5, install the <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/xdm</filename> script "
"and the <filename>/etc/sysconfig/xdm</filename> configuration file included "
"in the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package and adjust "
"<filename>/etc/inittab</filename> by running as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o &quot;<command>gdm</command>&quot; automaticamente quando o "
"sistema for comutado para o nível de execução 5, instale o conjunto de "
"comandos sequenciais &quot;<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/xdm</filename>&quot; e"
" o arquivo de configuração "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/sysconfig/xdm</filename>&quot; incluído no pacote "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/>&quot; e ajuste "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/inittab</filename>&quot; executando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:273
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-gdm</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-gdm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:276
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order to permanently set the default runlevel to 5, starting the "
"<command>gdm</command> greeter screen automatically, you can modify "
"<filename>/etc/inittab</filename>. As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de configurar permanentemente o nível de execução padrão "
"como 5, iniciando automaticamente a tela de boas-vindas do "
"&quot;<command>gdm</command>&quot;, você pode modificar o "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/inittab</filename>&quot;. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:282
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed /initdefault/s/3/5/ -i /etc/inittab</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed /initdefault/s/3/5/ -i /etc/inittab</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:285
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the <command>gdm</command> daemon at boot, enable the previously "
"installed systemd unit by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o processo de segundo plano &quot;<command>gdm</command>&quot; "
"na inicialização, habilite a unidade do &quot;systemd&quot; instalada "
"anteriormente executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:290
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl enable gdm</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl enable gdm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:307
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring GDM Auto-Suspend"
msgstr "Configurando Auto Suspensão do GDM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:310
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"GDM will suspend the system when the greeter screen has been running for a "
"while without any interactive input.  If you want to disable auto-suspending"
" for any reason (for example if the system is hosting some services besides "
"functioning as a desktop system), as the &root; user, issue:"
msgstr ""
"O GDM suspenderá o sistema quando a tela de saudação estiver executando por "
"um tempo sem qualquer entrada interativa. Se você quiser desabilitar a "
"suspensão automática por qualquer motivo (por exemplo, se o sistema estiver "
"hospedando alguns serviços além de funcionar como um sistema de área de "
"trabalho), como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/gdm.xml:317
